"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"6ip_dr3_fbl","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m022-0147","start":147,"end":148,"surface":"益","kind":"person","person_id":"gec_tof_7li","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m022-0153","start":153,"end":154,"surface":"啓","kind":"person","person_id":"t4u_no9_s1q","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m022-0164","start":164,"end":166,"surface":"子之","kind":"person","person_id":"8w9_x0s_cyf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m022-0171","start":171,"end":174,"surface":"太子人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m022-0179","start":179,"end":181,"surface":"子之","kind":"person","person_id":"8w9_x0s_cyf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m022-0195","start":195,"end":199,"surface":"三百石吏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m022-0204","start":204,"end":206,"surface":"子之","kind":"person","person_id":"8w9_x0s_cyf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m022-0207","start":207,"end":209,"surface":"子之","kind":"person","person_id":"8w9_x0s_cyf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m022-0216","start":216,"end":217,"surface":"噲","kind":"person","person_id":"n4f_fqh_04q_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m022-0231","start":231,"end":233,"surface":"子之","kind":"person","person_id":"8w9_x0s_cyf","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-034-yan","book_id":"b-shiji-034","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-034-yan"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p023","text":"三年，國大亂，百姓恫恐。將軍市被與太子平謀，將攻子之。諸將謂齊湣王曰：「因而赴之，破燕必矣。」齊王因令人謂燕太子平曰：「寡人聞太子之義，將廢私而立公，飭君臣之義，明父子之位。寡人之國小，不足以爲先後。雖然，則唯太子所以令之。」太子因要黨聚衆，將軍市被圍公宮，攻子之，不克。將軍市被及百姓反攻太子平，將軍市被死，以徇。因搆難數月，死者數萬，衆人恫恐，百姓離志。孟軻謂齊王曰：「今伐燕，此文、武之時，不可失也。」王因令章子將五都之兵，以因北地之衆以伐燕。士卒不戰，城門不閉，燕君噲死，齊大勝。燕子之亡二年，而燕人共立太子平，是爲燕昭王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m023-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"百姓","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m023-0012","start":12,"end":16,"surface":"將軍市被","kind":"person","person_id":"vs5_lya_vft","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m023-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"太子平","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m023-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"子之","kind":"person","person_id":"8w9_x0s_cyf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m023-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"諸將","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m023-0030","start":30,"end":33,"surface":"齊湣王","kind":"person","person_id":"1h3_vs7_t8h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m023-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"1h3_vs7_t8h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m023-0053","start":53,"end":57,"surface":"燕太子平","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m023-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"寡人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m023-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"5pw_05i_uhv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m023-0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"父子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"引語中的一般父子倫理稱謂，不指相子之，不補親屬端點。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m023-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"寡人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id